# API (`api/`)

## Today

Express stub with `GET /health` only (`api/src/index.js`).

## Planned stack

Express + Mongoose + MongoDB Atlas · JWT in httpOnly cookies (prefer Next rewrite proxy for first-party cookies)

## Planned collections

**users:** email (unique), passwordHash, isEmailVerified, verification/reset tokens, deletedAt, timestamps  

**portfolios:** userId (unique), title, slug (unique), status `draft|published`, paletteId, embedded `sections[]` (`id`, `type`, `order`, `visible`, `data`), publishedAt, timestamps

## Planned endpoints (implement when asked)

- Auth: signup, login, logout, verify-email, forgot/reset password, soft-delete account
- Portfolio: get/create (409 if exists), patch, delete, slug availability/change
- Public: `GET /public/:slug` (published only)

## Rules

- Validate inputs (Zod preferred when shared schemas land)
- Rate-limit auth + slug checks
- Soft-deleted users cannot authenticate; free their slug on account delete
- One portfolio per user enforced at DB unique index + application layer
